message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Divide and Collapse"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of an exact decomposition of MAPF-Collapse into
  independent sub-instances: reach sets, the interaction graph, a linear-time
  per-agent primitive, and C-CBS, an exact CBS adaptation for the coupled
  residue.
